{'symbol': 'PFE', 'date': '2021-09-07 10:00:00', 'title': 'PFIZER INVITES PUBLIC TO LISTEN TO TWO WEBCASTS OF PFIZER DISCUSSIONS AT UPCOMING HEALTHCARE CONFERENCES', 'text': "NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--PFIZER INC. (NYSE: PFE) INVITES INVESTORS AND THE GENERAL PUBLIC TO LISTEN TO TWO WEBCASTS OF DISCUSSIONS WITH PFIZER EXECUTIVES AT TWO UPCOMING HEALTHCARE CONFERENCES. FRANK D'AMELIO, CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER, EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT, GLOBAL SUPPLY, WILL HOLD A FIRESIDE CHAT AT THE MORGAN STANLEY 19TH ANNUAL GLOBAL HEALTHCARE CONFERENCE ON TUESDAY, SEPTEMBER 14, 2021 AT 10:15 A.M. EASTERN DAYLIGHT TIME. ANGELA HWANG, GROUP PRESIDENT, PFIZER BIOPHARMACEUTICALS GROUP,"}